"a node created by another document or making a node a descendant of itself, "
"rejects a second element or document type child of a document and a notation "
"child of a document fragment, reports attributes defaulted in the DTD and "
"whether an attribute was given in the start tag, and implements :class:`!"
"EntityReference` nodes and :meth:`!Document.createEntityReference`. "
"(Contributed by Jason Orendorff and Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`44871`.)"
msgstr ""

